sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant B as Browser /login/app
  participant F as web-sign-in function
  participant App as Phone app (signed in)
  B->>B: /login → Sign in with the app
  B->>F: start
  F-->>B: request id + secret (the secret never leaves the tab)
  B->>B: QR code holds only the id
  App->>App: drawer → Use on computer → Scan code
  App->>F: inspect(id), shows the browser's label
  App->>F: approve (as the signed-in user)
  loop until approved, declined or expired
    B->>F: poll(id, secret)
  end
  F-->>B: one-time token hash (generateLink)
  B->>B: verifyOtp → a session of its own
  Note over B,App: no session token ever travels in a URL · logging out on the web leaves the phone signed in
